      "name": "PySCF",
      "version": "2.13.1",
      "description": "Python-based Simulations of Chemistry Framework for ab-initio quantum chemistry. Includes periodic (pyscf.pbc) DFT/HF for crystalline solids with built-in GTH pseudopotentials and Gaussian basis sets -- computes total energies, band structures and band gaps fully self-contained (no external pseudopotential/parameter files). Real first-principles calculations that run natively on osx-arm64 (Apple Silicon), where plane-wave DFT codes (GPAW, Quantum ESPRESSO) have no build.",
